Title: "One Of"
Id: "fa7cdc38-2dfb-4681-a5d7-3797905764f3"

Text: "`oneOf:` contains mutually exclusive alternatives.

```mlg-fragment
oneOf:
. P
. Q
```

The group may have an optional label heading. Nested clauses use the same clause syntax recursively."
Id: "a8d0c892-bd58-4c43-8bf9-b49b2c163137"
